WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.960
Tennis elbow is not an inflammation: it is a degeneration of the tendon.

2
00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:09.000
It usually hurts when pressing right on the bone of the elbow and when extending the wrist against resistance.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Ultrasound lets us see the tendon in real time.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.200
It shows whether it is thickened, has lost its structure or has small tears.

5
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.200
An MRI is not always needed.

6
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.800
With a good examination and a good ultrasound,

7
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:23.800
in many cases the treatment can already be guided.

